[list]
[*] Tench-class submarine;
[*] Fletcher-class destroyer;
[*] Northampton-class cruiser;
[*] Iowa-class battleship;
[*] Essex-class aircraft carrier. 
[/list]
[b]Strategic Mind: The Pacific [/b]is a turn-based strategy set in the WW2 period depicting the war between the USA and the Empire of Japan waged in the Pacific Ocean. 

[b]Two Sides. Two Commanders. Two Destinies.[/b]

Add the game to your Wishlist on Steam! The store page is live already: https://store.steampowered.com/app/991810/Strategic_Mind_The_Pacific/

[olist]
[*]The issue when all units with turrets retaliate even if they are destroyed (negative STR) - FIXED;
[*]The issue when a captured armored train gets off the tracks - FIXED;
[*]One Ju-88A with torpedos ADDED in Norway scenario;
[*]Operation Citadel: the issue with the Supply Depot on the unpassable territory - FIXED;
[*]The pop-up "CloseDef" to indicate an armored target at Close Defense - ADDED;
[*]Ship attack on ground targets is DECREASED twice;
[*]Ship attack on air targets is INCREASED twice;
[*]Description of Rudolf Witzig "Assaulter" - ADDED.
[/olist]
